    "intro_narrative": "The rain outside smells of ozone and synthetic oil, a stark contrast to the sterile, chilled air of the underground corporate vault you've just infiltrated. You are a runner, hired by Fixer Jax to extract a highly guarded prototype AI core from a megacorporation's mainframe. The room is bathed in the eerie glow of neon blue and pink lights, humming with the low vibration of heavy server racks. Your objective is clear: override the mainframe and transmit the core data before the corporate security forces arrive. The system is layered with complex security protocols, scattered across various hacked devices left behind by a previous, less fortunate runner. You must navigate these makeshift tools, piece together the digital trail, and bypass the final override terminal to claim your prize and vanish into the neon-lit night.",
